      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "1) Sync order: sleep messages + stages FIRST\n   \u2192 window continuous HR\n   \u2192 TruSleep FileDownload LAST (non-blocking)\n2) Toggle TruSleep \u2194 continuous HR ONLY if\n   TruSleep enrich present for that session\n3) Quality score + Advanced metrics DEFERRED\n4) IA: bottom tab Vitals \u2192 Recovery\n   with Vitals | Sleep subtabs\n5) Display BOTH structure + HR when available",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Sync order: sleep messages + stages FIRST\n   \u2192 window continuous HR\n   \u2192 TruSleep FileDownload LAST (non-blocking)\n2) Toggle TruSleep \u2194 continuous HR ONLY if\n   TruSleep enrich present for that session\n3) Quality score + Advanced metrics DEFERRED\n4) IA: bottom tab Vitals \u2192 Recovery\n   with Vitals | Sleep subtabs\n5) Display BOTH structure + HR when available",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "zLock2"
